# Test Driven Development (TDD)
- Write tests before writing implementation logic
- For each feature:
  1. Create a failing test first (JUnit 5)
  2. Implement code minimal to pass test
  3. Refactor and improve coverage
- Use explicit test naming: given_when_then pattern
- Keep unit tests fast (mock external resources)
- Use integration tests with H2 database for DAO/Repository layers